{"number":102,"arabic":"سُورَةُ التَّكَاثُرِ","name":"At-Takaathur","meaning":"Competition","ayahs":[{"n":1,"g":6169,"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":2,"g":6170,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","en":"Until you visit the graveyards.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":3,"g":6171,"ar":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"No! You are going to know.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":4,"g":6172,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"Then no! You are going to know.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":5,"g":6173,"ar":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":6,"g":6174,"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","en":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":7,"g":6175,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":8,"g":6176,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false}],"revelation":"Meccan"}